      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda worried about my partner they have type 1 diabetes and they've been acting really weird for the last few hours. they keep asking for water non stop and they seem super nauseous and kinda confused too. they also said they feel really sleepy. i think maybe their sugar is just high? should they just drink a bunch of water and try to sleep it off?",
