      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait but they aren't even passing out or anything, they're just acting a bit out of it. and their breath smells kinda sweet, like fruit or something? i checked their monitor and it says their sugar is high but not like, crazy high. i really dont want to deal with an ER visit if we can just fix it here. isn't it better to just give them some insulin and let them rest? what if the hospital just makes it a bigger deal than it is?",
